kzero is a configuration-first CLI for ordered Kubernetes workload pipelines:
down, up, and reset from YAML, with phase hooks, optional per-step pre/post
scripts, kubectl scale targets, Helm release helpers, and custom steps.

The package installs the static binary, the MIT license text, and a sample
configuration under share/examples/kzero/.

WWW: https://github.com/hrodrig/kzero
